[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     69[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `compile_block`, `match_block`, `dfa_match_block`, `pcre2_memctl`, ...), the option
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     70[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and error constants, the opcodes, `CHAR_*`/`STR_*`/`STRING_*` names, and the UCD
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     71[0m:[38;5;10m[49m access helpers already exist. Read these before writing code:
